WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to the deep dive on body, soul and spirit.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Let's begin with the physical body.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The physical body is often referred to in ancient Biblical scriptures as the Earthly Vessel.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
It's the temple. It's the physical part of you that interacts with the physical world.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
It's the house that occupies your soul and your spirit.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
In the physical body part, you have the basic elements here.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:41.000
On the screen, things like the senses such as sight, touch, taste, hearing, smell and so forth.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
The physical body has a correlation to the soul.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
When you're taking care of your physical body, you're eating well, you're taking care of yourself,

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
you're drinking fresh air, you're washing, you're cleansing well, it can help you feel good.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.000
That's the next component here where we look at the soul component.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.000
The soul is comprised of, and again, if we're looking at this from a Biblical reference,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.000
it is our emotions, our will and our mind.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.000
That includes the whole gammon of emotions that we can feel.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
It's all the way from shame, which is one of the heaviest, hardest emotions,

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000
all the way through to wonderful, expansive love.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:36.000
We have the will and in the ancient scriptures, this is the part of us that wants to come into more of an alignment with a spirit.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.000
The spirit is the part, again, this is working off the Biblical reference.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.000
This is the closest to God, because God is in spirit and He communicates spirit to spirit.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:55.000
So often, you'll have people going their whole lives, I was actually watching a video today where there was a lady who grew up in a very intelligent intellectuals,

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:03.000
cerebelly focused, so mind focused, that's the soul, family, where they had an initial belief in God,

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.000
but they rationalized it away with the intellect.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.000
The soul component, the intelligence, was dominant.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Now, even in the component of the soul, you can meet people that believe all the answers to life are found through the cerebral intelligence, the mind.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
The mind is the type of God or it's on the pedestal for certain individuals.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Now, I was one of these people, to a degree, where knowledge was my currency of value,

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.000
because I was a consultant, I used to help all kinds of people from grief and rape,

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:43.000
to elite athletes, to business leaders, and there was always a pressure on me to deliver results for my clients.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:54.000
And therefore, the acquisition of knowledge, intelligence, human behavioral skills was very dominant in me.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Then there are other people you can meet where they're very dominant in their emotions,

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:08.000
and what they feel is reality, and they're very, very emotionally driven.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:16.000
Now, you can have also people that are very geared towards the body, where the body holds information,

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:22.000
and what they're feeling, and what their body is telling them is reality,

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.000
and they're not necessarily connected so strongly to the spirit.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:34.000
You can have people that love to just get the dopamine high or the adrenaline from physical activity.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.000
They'll run a lot or train a lot, and these are great things, but this becomes their drug,

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:43.000
and they might be quite disconnected from their emotions.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:51.000
They might be quite shut off, and so their way of getting safety or certainty is to work the physical body,

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:56.000
because it's easy, it's familiar, but to go into the landscape of their emotions

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:03.000
and to feel some of the uncomfortable feelings, to process their fear, etc., is just too difficult.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.000
It's too uncomfortable, and so you'll have people who have that underdevelopment in one area

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.000
or an overdevelopment in another area.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:17.000
I've worked with a number of mentors over the years where some were much more mentally focused

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:23.000
and others were much more about the body and the emotions, and the emotions have intelligence, and so forth.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:32.000
Then you'll have many, many stories from all around the world where you'll meet super-intelligent doctors, scientists,

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:37.000
and then they have a near-death experience, NDE, they're referred to as,

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.000
or they might just have some type of supernatural encounter. This happens with my father,

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:47.000
where my father was trying to understand the Bible, for example, and he was reading the book of Revelation,

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:53.000
and he goes, I don't understand this crap, and this is all fairy-tales, blah, blah, blah, blah, blah.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:05:00.000
I guess I'm just, I can't do this, so his mind couldn't understand it, he tried, it didn't make sense,

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.000
and he was very frustrated and he went to bed that day.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:09.000
And my father at the time was having also a bit of an alcoholic drinking problem, and then, boom,

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:16.000
he got hit by some type of light, he thought he was having a stroke, he kind of turned over and there was his light,

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:22.000
and it changed him in such a way. In fact, I was living in Europe at the time, and I got on a phone call with him,

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:30.000
this was pre-Internet, and all the Internet was just getting started, and he sounded so different, he was so kind,

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.000
I was like, I was looking at the phone going, what the heck has happened to my father, who is this man?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:42.000
He had a spiritual encounter with the Holy Spirit, and this changed his life, and so you hear millions of stories,

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:48.000
not hundreds of thousands, it's in the millions, if not more, where people have an encounter in the Spirit,

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:53.000
and it changes them in a very, very profound way.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:06:02.000
And so this is the realm of the Spirit, it's a little bit harder to describe than these other realms,

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:12.000
the physical realm is so well defined, everyone experiences that, some people just have an awakening of some kind about the emotions,

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:22.000
and the mental, and insights, and so therefore you can have varying degrees of dialogue with people based on their development at the level of the soul,

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:30.000
and you can have people who are really quite, they've had encounters here, the Spirit, and they really feel alive here,

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.000
but they're actually quite underdeveloped at the level of the soul, and they're not taking care of their body.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:42.000
So again, these are ways to look at it, I mean I've seen people who are super spiritual, who believe God can do everything,

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:50.000
and I'm going to live forever, but yet they're overweight and not taking care of themselves physically, thinking God's going to do it all.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:56.000
So it's interesting, you see where people's focuses are, and I can relate to this, where there was a period in my life,

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:05.000
where I was very focused on here, I had encounters, I had a number of experiences, and I started to believe that Spirit is everything, it's everything,

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:15.000
and in some ways it is everything, but I actually had a physical problem that needed a physical adjustment, some people describe this as the hardware,

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:22.000
so I had to stop having gluten, I had to stop having certain food, and my physical body started to heal,

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:32.000
and I was so surprised because I was so sure that it wasn't physical, I just thought everything's spiritual, everything is in the Spirit.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:38.000
And then there are other situations where people spend their whole lives physically working and acquiring wealth,

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:46.000
because they think, that's the soul, the mind, the will, that all the solutions are in the physical material world,

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:55.000
they arrive at the pinnacle of what they thought they were going to achieve, and something's missing, and they're empty, and they go soul searching,

00:07:55.000 --> 00:08:00.000
but the answer's not necessarily in the soul, it's here in the Spirit.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:11.000
And so, again, a lot of times when people have NDE's, and these are the experiences, they struggle to language it, and I can relate to this.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:21.000
I've had a number of encounters where I've heard music in the angelic realms, that you cannot play that music in this realm, it doesn't exist here.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:27.000
And when I begin to describe it, I don't have the language, because what is language?

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:40.000
It's a pre-existing, shared set of words that we're using that you're listening to me through, that enable us to describe a particular thing.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:55.000
But when I've had a new experience that's beyond words, it's from another realm, from the Spirit, it's, you can understand why, it's difficult to condense it down into language and into words.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:03.000
So, it's really important to have this overarching awareness of these three levels, body, soul, and spirit.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:10.000
This is the one where the Bible's very adamant that God is Spirit, and you can interact with Him in Spirit.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:24.000
There's a story in my life where I physically got ill, my career was over in sport, I got into a relationship, I was long story short, I was absolutely broken at the level of the heart, the emotions, and the soul.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:33.000
I was crying out to God, I felt I'd reached the end of myself, and all of a sudden God spoke to me in a voice so clear.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.000
It sounded like Johnny Cash's song there, if you've heard that song.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:40.000
And I was just like, wow, my God, why now, God, why now, why now?

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:44.000
It was my first question, because I prayed many times before and nothing happened.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:51.000
And it was almost like this echo came back, I can't explain it, it's like telepathic, because it's beyond words.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:10:10.000
And what I felt God say to me is that now you're ready, you're open, because all the realms of the soul and the physical, all the fantasies you had, all the things you thought were going to bring you, what you thought they're going to give you, the illusions, they didn't actually satisfy or satiate you.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:16.000
Now you've come to a point where you've cried out from the depths of your being to me, and okay, I'll speak to you.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:20.000
I can't explain it any more than that, that's just what happened in the experience.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:29.000
And so this is, again, an overarching look at the body, soul and spirit.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:38.000
And it's a beautiful thing to know the difference, and I hope you've got something out of this presentation, I hope you found it interesting.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:43.000
And I wonder if you can reflect on your own life on where are you primarily focused at?

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.000
Are you someone that's always the mind when there's a problem?

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.000
How in touch are you with your emotions?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.000
How well do you take care of your physical senses?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.000
And have you had spiritual encounters?

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.000
And what are they like?

00:10:55.000 --> 00:11:05.000
Now I will conclude in saying, in my vast experience on this topic, or vast experience that I've had, not all spirit is the same.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:13.000
Not all spirits are the same, and they have a different intention behind them, and that takes experience to better work that out.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:29.000
When you have had an encounter with the Holy Spirit or Christ, you do have extremely strong reference to be able to contrast other spirits that are out there, because there's a world of spirits out there.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:36.000
And when you are open to that, you can sense that, and you'll be able to feel them and sense them, so your soul is involved.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:47.000
Now the ultimate goal, as far as I'm aware in mystical Christianity, is to get the body to submit and obey the soul.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:53.000
Why? Because you can't have your body say, I'm tired, I'm lazy, I don't want to do anything, I want to eat what I want, I want to do what I want.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:12:00.000
Wait, the will is here in the soul, and the soul can rule over the body and say, no, we're not going to be eating that.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:08.000
We're going to get up now, we're going to go for a walk, we're going to do this irrespective of how we may feel, or how the body may feel.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:13.000
And so this is where the soul is to govern over our body.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:24.000
And then ultimately we want the soul, and I've definitely had encounters of this where my spirit dominates my soul, and my soul is observing my spirit.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:32.000
And that's a whole other experience altogether. Perhaps some of you have experienced that just yet.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:37.000
But there you have it, that's the body, soul and spirit, and trust you've enjoyed it. Thank you.